export const escapeHtml=(r="")=>String(r??"").replace(/&/g,"&amp;").replace(/</g,"&lt;").replace(/>/g,"&gt;").replace(/"/g,"&quot;").replace(/'/g,"&#039;"),safeUrl=(r,t="https://www.sahibinden.com/")=>{if(!r)return t;try{const e=new URL(String(r),window.location.origin);if(["http:","https:"].includes(e.protocol))return escapeHtml(e.href)}catch{return t}return t},safeImageUrl=(r,t="/assets/images/placeholder.svg")=>{if(!r)return t;try{const e=new URL(String(r),window.location.origin);if(["http:","https:"].includes(e.protocol))return escapeHtml(e.href)}catch{return t}return t};
